==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|is|far|seðill|t1=passage|t2=ticket}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈfar̥.sɛːðɪtl/}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun/old|m|farseðils|farseðlar}}

# transportation [[ticket]]; a pass entitling the holder to board a train, a bus, a plane, or other means of transportation.

